  "web": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n<meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light\">\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex, nofollow\">\n<title>New from Mach II Labs: Skagway 1.5 and 15CE Flasher 1.4</title>\n<style>\n  body { margin: 0; padding: 0; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n  a { color: #1d4ed8; }\n  a.nl-link:hover { text-decoration: underline !important; text-underline-offset: 2px; }\n  @media (max-width: 620px) {\n    .px { padding-left: 16px !important; padding-right: 16px !important; }\n    .card-pad { padding-left: 18px !important; padding-right: 18px !important; }\n    .headline { font-size: 26px !important; line-height: 32px !important; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#eceef1;\">\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#eceef1\" style=\"background:#eceef1;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 0 32px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0 10px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<!--newsletter:corrections-->\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#070b12\" align=\"center\" class=\"px\" style=\"padding:36px 32px 34px;\">\n<a href=\"https://machiilabs.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://machiilabs.com/newsletter/shared/logo-mark.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" alt=\"Mach II Labs\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;max-width:48px;height:auto;margin:0 auto;\"></a>\n<div style=\"height:16px;line-height:16px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9aa8bd;\">Mach II Labs · No. 1 · November 2026</p>\n<h1 class=\"headline\" style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:32px;line-height:38px;font-weight:800;color:#eef2f7;\">What’s new from Mach II Labs</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;color:#9aa8bd;\">Skagway 1.5 · 15CE Flasher 1.4 for Mac and 1.2 for Windows</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background:#ffffff;padding:0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:32px 32px 12px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;color:#1f2937;\">Hello,</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;color:#1f2937;\">Thanks for signing up for news from Mach II Labs. We’ll only write when there’s something worth your time.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;color:#1f2937;\">Mach II Labs currently offers two free apps, Skagway and 15CE Flasher, with more terrific apps on the way.</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:12px 32px 20px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border:1px solid #e2e5ea;border-radius:10px;border-collapse:separate;overflow:hidden;\">\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#eef3f8\" class=\"card-pad\" style=\"padding:22px 24px;border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td valign=\"middle\" width=\"56\" style=\"width:56px;padding-right:16px;\"><img src=\"https://machiilabs.com/newsletter/shared/skagway-icon.png\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" alt=\"Skagway icon\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;max-width:56px;height:auto;border-radius:12px;\"></td>\n<td valign=\"middle\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b6472;\">Video organizer · Mac · Free</p>\n<h2 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:800;color:#070b12;\">Skagway</h2>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#070b12;\">A Mac video organizer for the files already on your drives.</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0;border-top:1px solid #e2e5ea;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e5ea;\"><img src=\"https://machiilabs.com/newsletter/2026-01/skagway-library.jpg\" width=\"534\" height=\"255\" alt=\"Skagway’s grid view: a large video library with thumbnails, ratings, and tags\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;max-width:534px;height:auto;\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"card-pad\" style=\"padding:22px 24px 26px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#1f2937;\">Point Skagway at the folders you already have, on this Mac or an external drive. It catalogs every clip and builds thumbnails, and your files stay exactly where they are.</p>\n<div style=\"height:22px;line-height:22px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b6472;\">Highlights</p>\n<div style=\"height:10px;line-height:10px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Find any moment by eye</strong><br>Rest on a thumbnail and a silent preview plays. Storyboard shows six frames of every video.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Organize without moving anything</strong><br>Tags, star ratings, albums, and smart collections, with search and filters across the whole library.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Fast with thousands of videos</strong><br>Long or short, tiny or enormous, the library stays smooth.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Free forever, private by default</strong><br>No account, no ads, no subscription, and no telemetry.</p>\n<div style=\"height:24px;line-height:24px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#fdf5e9\" style=\"padding:18px 20px;border-left:4px solid #e8a045;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:22px;font-weight:800;color:#070b12;\">New in Skagway 1.5</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Make a playable copy</strong><br>Skagway now converts videos your Mac can’t play into a playable MP4 copy. Many formats are supported, and your original stays in the catalog.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Better Bulk Rename</strong><br>Templates, undo, and a smoother flow for renaming many files at once.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Recently: rate and tag from the card</strong><br>Since 1.4, stars (keys 1–5) and tags work right on the card, without opening the Inspector.</p>\n</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:24px;line-height:24px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#e8a045\" style=\"border-radius:6px;\">\n<a href=\"https://machiilabs.com/skagway\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#070b12;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;\">Get Skagway 1.5</a>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:#5b6472;\">macOS 26 or later</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:12px 32px 20px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border:1px solid #e2e5ea;border-radius:10px;border-collapse:separate;overflow:hidden;\">\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#f8f1e8\" class=\"card-pad\" style=\"padding:22px 24px;border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td valign=\"middle\" width=\"56\" style=\"width:56px;padding-right:16px;\"><img src=\"https://machiilabs.com/newsletter/shared/flasher-icon.png\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" alt=\"15CE Flasher icon\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;max-width:56px;height:auto;border-radius:12px;\"></td>\n<td valign=\"middle\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b6472;\">Calculator firmware · Mac &amp; Windows · Free</p>\n<h2 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:800;color:#070b12;\">15CE Flasher</h2>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#070b12;\">A guided flasher for the HP 15c and 16c Collector’s Editions.</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0;border-top:1px solid #e2e5ea;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e5ea;\"><img src=\"https://machiilabs.com/newsletter/2026-01/flasher-wizard.jpg\" width=\"534\" height=\"457\" alt=\"15CE Flasher 1.4.1’s first step: a diagram of the pogo cable seated in the calculator and plugged into a Mac\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;max-width:534px;height:auto;\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"card-pad\" style=\"padding:22px 24px 26px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#1f2937;\">Updating a Collector’s Edition calculator used to mean command-line tools and guesswork. 15CE Flasher walks you through every step over the official pogo cable, available from <a href=\"https://www.thecalculatorstore.com/p/data-cable-for-hp-calculators\" class=\"nl-link\" style=\"color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">The Calculator Store</a>. It works on the HP 15c and 16c Collector’s Editions and the post-2015 HP 12c.</p>\n<div style=\"height:22px;line-height:22px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b6472;\">Highlights</p>\n<div style=\"height:10px;line-height:10px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">A seven-step wizard</strong><br>Diagrams and clear status at every step, from seating the cable to the final checksum.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Rehearse first in DEMO mode</strong><br>Walk through the whole process with a simulated calculator. No hardware needed.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Careful by design</strong><br>It leaves the bootloader intact, offers a backup before writing, and verifies afterward.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">BATCH mode and offline</strong><br>Flash several calculators in a row. No network and no telemetry.</p>\n<div style=\"height:24px;line-height:24px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#fdf5e9\" style=\"padding:18px 20px;border-left:4px solid #e8a045;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:22px;font-weight:800;color:#070b12;\">New in 1.4 for Mac and 1.2 for Windows</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Knows your firmware</strong><br>The app reads the calculator, names the firmware it finds, and suggests a backup file name based on its version.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Catches the wrong file</strong><br>If the firmware you choose is for a different model than the calculator, you’re warned before anything is written.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">16c and 12c support</strong><br>It recognizes the HP 16c Collector’s Edition, including its Extended Memory and stopwatch firmware, and the post-2015 HP 12c.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Windows catches up</strong><br>Windows 1.2 brings all of this to the PC.</p>\n</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:24px;line-height:24px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#e8a045\" style=\"border-radius:6px;\">\n<a href=\"https://machiilabs.com/flasher\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#070b12;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;\">Get 15CE Flasher</a>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:#5b6472;\">macOS 13+ · Windows 10/11 (64-bit) · official pogo cable</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:8px 32px 36px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;color:#1f2937;\">Questions, ideas, or a bug to report? Just reply to this email.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;color:#1f2937;\">Thanks for using our apps,<br>Paul<br>Mach II Labs</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:24px 32px 0;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#5b6472;\">This is the web copy of a Mach II Labs newsletter. Subscribers can leave the list with the unsubscribe link at the bottom of the email.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#5b6472;\">Mach II Labs · P.O. Box 72004 · Phoenix, AZ 85050</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#5b6472;\"><a href=\"https://machiilabs.com\" class=\"nl-link\" style=\"color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">machiilabs.com</a> · <a href=\"https://machiilabs.com/privacy\" class=\"nl-link\" style=\"color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\"mailto:support@machiilabs.com\" class=\"nl-link\" style=\"color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">support@machiilabs.com</a></p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
  "email": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n<meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light\">\n<title>New from Mach II Labs: Skagway 1.5 and 15CE Flasher 1.4</title>\n<style>\n  body { margin: 0; padding: 0; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n  a { color: #1d4ed8; }\n  a.nl-link:hover { text-decoration: underline !important; text-underline-offset: 2px; }\n  @media (max-width: 620px) {\n    .px { padding-left: 16px !important; padding-right: 16px !important; }\n    .card-pad { padding-left: 18px !important; padding-right: 18px !important; }\n    .headline { font-size: 26px !important; line-height: 32px !important; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#eceef1;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#eceef1;\">Skagway makes playable copies of stubborn videos, and 15CE Flasher now recognizes your calculator’s firmware.&#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; &#8199;&#65279;&#847; </div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#eceef1\" style=\"background:#eceef1;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 0 32px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;\">\n<tr><td align=\"right\" class=\"px\" style=\"padding:14px 32px 10px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#5b6472;\">\n<a href=\"https://machiilabs.com/newsletter/2026-01\" class=\"nl-link\" style=\"color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">View in browser</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#070b12\" align=\"center\" class=\"px\" style=\"padding:36px 32px 34px;\">\n<a href=\"https://machiilabs.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://machiilabs.com/newsletter/shared/logo-mark.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" alt=\"Mach II Labs\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;max-width:48px;height:auto;margin:0 auto;\"></a>\n<div style=\"height:16px;line-height:16px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9aa8bd;\">Mach II Labs · No. 1 · November 2026</p>\n<h1 class=\"headline\" style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:32px;line-height:38px;font-weight:800;color:#eef2f7;\">What’s new from Mach II Labs</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;color:#9aa8bd;\">Skagway 1.5 · 15CE Flasher 1.4 for Mac and 1.2 for Windows</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background:#ffffff;padding:0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:32px 32px 12px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;color:#1f2937;\">Hello,</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;color:#1f2937;\">Thanks for signing up for news from Mach II Labs. We’ll only write when there’s something worth your time.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;color:#1f2937;\">Mach II Labs currently offers two free apps, Skagway and 15CE Flasher, with more terrific apps on the way.</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:12px 32px 20px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border:1px solid #e2e5ea;border-radius:10px;border-collapse:separate;overflow:hidden;\">\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#eef3f8\" class=\"card-pad\" style=\"padding:22px 24px;border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td valign=\"middle\" width=\"56\" style=\"width:56px;padding-right:16px;\"><img src=\"https://machiilabs.com/newsletter/shared/skagway-icon.png\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" alt=\"Skagway icon\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;max-width:56px;height:auto;border-radius:12px;\"></td>\n<td valign=\"middle\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b6472;\">Video organizer · Mac · Free</p>\n<h2 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:800;color:#070b12;\">Skagway</h2>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#070b12;\">A Mac video organizer for the files already on your drives.</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0;border-top:1px solid #e2e5ea;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e5ea;\"><img src=\"https://machiilabs.com/newsletter/2026-01/skagway-library.jpg\" width=\"534\" height=\"255\" alt=\"Skagway’s grid view: a large video library with thumbnails, ratings, and tags\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;max-width:534px;height:auto;\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"card-pad\" style=\"padding:22px 24px 26px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#1f2937;\">Point Skagway at the folders you already have, on this Mac or an external drive. It catalogs every clip and builds thumbnails, and your files stay exactly where they are.</p>\n<div style=\"height:22px;line-height:22px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b6472;\">Highlights</p>\n<div style=\"height:10px;line-height:10px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Find any moment by eye</strong><br>Rest on a thumbnail and a silent preview plays. Storyboard shows six frames of every video.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Organize without moving anything</strong><br>Tags, star ratings, albums, and smart collections, with search and filters across the whole library.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Fast with thousands of videos</strong><br>Long or short, tiny or enormous, the library stays smooth.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Free forever, private by default</strong><br>No account, no ads, no subscription, and no telemetry.</p>\n<div style=\"height:24px;line-height:24px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#fdf5e9\" style=\"padding:18px 20px;border-left:4px solid #e8a045;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:22px;font-weight:800;color:#070b12;\">New in Skagway 1.5</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Make a playable copy</strong><br>Skagway now converts videos your Mac can’t play into a playable MP4 copy. Many formats are supported, and your original stays in the catalog.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Better Bulk Rename</strong><br>Templates, undo, and a smoother flow for renaming many files at once.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Recently: rate and tag from the card</strong><br>Since 1.4, stars (keys 1–5) and tags work right on the card, without opening the Inspector.</p>\n</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:24px;line-height:24px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#e8a045\" style=\"border-radius:6px;\">\n<a href=\"https://machiilabs.com/skagway\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#070b12;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;\">Get Skagway 1.5</a>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:#5b6472;\">macOS 26 or later</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:12px 32px 20px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border:1px solid #e2e5ea;border-radius:10px;border-collapse:separate;overflow:hidden;\">\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#f8f1e8\" class=\"card-pad\" style=\"padding:22px 24px;border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td valign=\"middle\" width=\"56\" style=\"width:56px;padding-right:16px;\"><img src=\"https://machiilabs.com/newsletter/shared/flasher-icon.png\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" alt=\"15CE Flasher icon\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;max-width:56px;height:auto;border-radius:12px;\"></td>\n<td valign=\"middle\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b6472;\">Calculator firmware · Mac &amp; Windows · Free</p>\n<h2 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:800;color:#070b12;\">15CE Flasher</h2>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#070b12;\">A guided flasher for the HP 15c and 16c Collector’s Editions.</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0;border-top:1px solid #e2e5ea;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e5ea;\"><img src=\"https://machiilabs.com/newsletter/2026-01/flasher-wizard.jpg\" width=\"534\" height=\"457\" alt=\"15CE Flasher 1.4.1’s first step: a diagram of the pogo cable seated in the calculator and plugged into a Mac\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;max-width:534px;height:auto;\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"card-pad\" style=\"padding:22px 24px 26px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#1f2937;\">Updating a Collector’s Edition calculator used to mean command-line tools and guesswork. 15CE Flasher walks you through every step over the official pogo cable, available from <a href=\"https://www.thecalculatorstore.com/p/data-cable-for-hp-calculators\" class=\"nl-link\" style=\"color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">The Calculator Store</a>. It works on the HP 15c and 16c Collector’s Editions and the post-2015 HP 12c.</p>\n<div style=\"height:22px;line-height:22px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b6472;\">Highlights</p>\n<div style=\"height:10px;line-height:10px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">A seven-step wizard</strong><br>Diagrams and clear status at every step, from seating the cable to the final checksum.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Rehearse first in DEMO mode</strong><br>Walk through the whole process with a simulated calculator. No hardware needed.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Careful by design</strong><br>It leaves the bootloader intact, offers a backup before writing, and verifies afterward.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">BATCH mode and offline</strong><br>Flash several calculators in a row. No network and no telemetry.</p>\n<div style=\"height:24px;line-height:24px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#fdf5e9\" style=\"padding:18px 20px;border-left:4px solid #e8a045;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:22px;font-weight:800;color:#070b12;\">New in 1.4 for Mac and 1.2 for Windows</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Knows your firmware</strong><br>The app reads the calculator, names the firmware it finds, and suggests a backup file name based on its version.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Catches the wrong file</strong><br>If the firmware you choose is for a different model than the calculator, you’re warned before anything is written.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">16c and 12c support</strong><br>It recognizes the HP 16c Collector’s Edition, including its Extended Memory and stopwatch firmware, and the post-2015 HP 12c.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;\"><strong style=\"color:#070b12;\">Windows catches up</strong><br>Windows 1.2 brings all of this to the PC.</p>\n</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:24px;line-height:24px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#e8a045\" style=\"border-radius:6px;\">\n<a href=\"https://machiilabs.com/flasher\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#070b12;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;\">Get 15CE Flasher</a>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:#5b6472;\">macOS 13+ · Windows 10/11 (64-bit) · official pogo cable</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:8px 32px 36px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;color:#1f2937;\">Questions, ideas, or a bug to report? Just reply to this email.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;color:#1f2937;\">Thanks for using our apps,<br>Paul<br>Mach II Labs</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:24px 32px 0;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#5b6472;\">You’re receiving this because you signed up for Mach II Labs product news at machiilabs.com.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#5b6472;\">If you don’t want to receive this type of email in the future, please <a href=\"https://machiilabs.com/mailing-list/unsubscribe?token=~unsubscribe_token\" class=\"nl-link\" style=\"color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">unsubscribe</a>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#5b6472;\">Mach II Labs · P.O. Box 72004 · Phoenix, AZ 85050</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#5b6472;\"><a href=\"https://machiilabs.com\" class=\"nl-link\" style=\"color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">machiilabs.com</a> · <a href=\"https://machiilabs.com/privacy\" class=\"nl-link\" style=\"color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\"mailto:support@machiilabs.com\" class=\"nl-link\" style=\"color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">support@machiilabs.com</a></p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
  "text": "MACH II LABS · No. 1 · November 2026\nWhat’s new from Mach II Labs\nSkagway 1.5 · 15CE Flasher 1.4 for Mac and 1.2 for Windows\n\nView in your browser: https://machiilabs.com/newsletter/2026-01\n\nHello,\n\nThanks for signing up for news from Mach II Labs. We’ll only write when there’s something worth your time.\n\nMach II Labs currently offers two free apps, Skagway and 15CE Flasher, with more terrific apps on the way.\n\n================================================\nSKAGWAY\nVideo organizer · Mac · Free\n\nA Mac video organizer for the files already on your drives.\n\nPoint Skagway at the folders you already have, on this Mac or an external drive. It catalogs every clip and builds thumbnails, and your files stay exactly where they are.\n\nHighlights\n- Find any moment by eye: Rest on a thumbnail and a silent preview plays. Storyboard shows six frames of every video.\n- Organize without moving anything: Tags, star ratings, albums, and smart collections, with search and filters across the whole library.\n- Fast with thousands of videos: Long or short, tiny or enormous, the library stays smooth.\n- Free forever, private by default: No account, no ads, no subscription, and no telemetry.\n\nNew in Skagway 1.5\n- Make a playable copy: Skagway now converts videos your Mac can’t play into a playable MP4 copy. Many formats are supported, and your original stays in the catalog.\n- Better Bulk Rename: Templates, undo, and a smoother flow for renaming many files at once.\n- Recently: rate and tag from the card: Since 1.4, stars (keys 1–5) and tags work right on the card, without opening the Inspector.\n\nGet Skagway 1.5: https://machiilabs.com/skagway\nmacOS 26 or later\n\n================================================\n15CE FLASHER\nCalculator firmware · Mac & Windows · Free\n\nA guided flasher for the HP 15c and 16c Collector’s Editions.\n\nUpdating a Collector’s Edition calculator used to mean command-line tools and guesswork. 15CE Flasher walks you through every step over the official pogo cable, available from The Calculator Store (https://www.thecalculatorstore.com/p/data-cable-for-hp-calculators). It works on the HP 15c and 16c Collector’s Editions and the post-2015 HP 12c.\n\nHighlights\n- A seven-step wizard: Diagrams and clear status at every step, from seating the cable to the final checksum.\n- Rehearse first in DEMO mode: Walk through the whole process with a simulated calculator. No hardware needed.\n- Careful by design: It leaves the bootloader intact, offers a backup before writing, and verifies afterward.\n- BATCH mode and offline: Flash several calculators in a row. No network and no telemetry.\n\nNew in 1.4 for Mac and 1.2 for Windows\n- Knows your firmware: The app reads the calculator, names the firmware it finds, and suggests a backup file name based on its version.\n- Catches the wrong file: If the firmware you choose is for a different model than the calculator, you’re warned before anything is written.\n- 16c and 12c support: It recognizes the HP 16c Collector’s Edition, including its Extended Memory and stopwatch firmware, and the post-2015 HP 12c.\n- Windows catches up: Windows 1.2 brings all of this to the PC.\n\nGet 15CE Flasher: https://machiilabs.com/flasher\nmacOS 13+ · Windows 10/11 (64-bit) · official pogo cable\n\n================================================\n\nQuestions, ideas, or a bug to report? Just reply to this email.\n\nThanks for using our apps,\nPaul\nMach II Labs\n\n--\nYou’re receiving this because you signed up for Mach II Labs product news at machiilabs.com.\nIf you don’t want to receive this type of email in the future, unsubscribe here: https://machiilabs.com/mailing-list/unsubscribe?token=~unsubscribe_token\nMach II Labs · P.O. Box 72004 · Phoenix, AZ 85050\n"
}
